---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';
---

<Base
  title={`各游戏体验记录 · ${SITE.name}`}
  description="玩过的游戏和随手记"
  bodyClass="mode-fun"
  mainClass="article-main"
>
  <article class="article">
    <header class="article-head">
      <p class="works-eyebrow">文章 · 02</p>
      <h1 class="article-title">各游戏体验记录</h1>
      <p class="article-en">PLAY LOGS</p>
    </header>

    <div class="article-body">
      <p>还没有内容。等玩到想写的，就往这儿放。</p>
    </div>

    <p class="works-foot">
      <a href="/articles/">回文章</a>
      <a href="/">回首页</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
